配项','Found %1$d match in %2$d tabs'=>'在 %2$d 标签中找到了 %1$d 个匹配项','Found %1$d matches in %2$d tab'=>'在 %2$d 标签中找到了 %1$d 个匹配项','Found %1$d matches in %2$d tabs'=>'在 %2$d 标签中找到了 %1$d 个匹配项','No matches found for "%s"'=>'未找到与 "%s" 匹配的项','Select all roles'=>'选择所有角色','Role Name'=>'角色名称','Role Type'=>'角色类型','Default Role'=>'默认角色','Admin Access'=>'管理员访问','You do not have permission to manage roles.'=>'您没有管理角色的权限。','You do not have permission to manage editor features.'=>'您没有管理编辑器功能的权限。','You do not have permission to manage admin features.'=>'您没有管理管理员功能的权限。','You do not have permission to manage navigation menus.'=>'您没有管理导航菜单的权限。','You do not have permission to manage profile features.'=>'您没有管理个人资料功能的权限。','You do not have permission to manage redirect.'=>'您没有管理重定向的权限。','Invalid form. Reload this page and try again.'=>'无效的表单。请重新加载此页面并重试。','You do not have permission to manage capabilities.'=>'您没有管理能力的权限。','Network sync completed.'=>'网络同步已完成。','Network sync has been queued and will continue in the background.'=>'网络同步已排队，将在后台继续进行。','New capability added to role.'=>'新能力已添加到角色。','Bad form Received'=>'收到错误的表单','You do not have permission to restore roles.'=>'您没有恢复角色的权限。','You do not have permission to perform this action.'=>'您没有执行此操作的权限。','Select at least one role to export.'=>'请至少选择一个角色进行导出。','There are no users in this role on this site. Add a user to this role, then find profile items again.'=>'此站点中此角色没有用户。请为此角色添加用户，然后再次查找个人资料项目。','Profile items could not be detected because User Testing is disabled, you cannot test the user in this role, or the user cannot access the Profile screen.'=>'无法检测到个人资料项目，因为用户测试已禁用，您无法测试此角色中的用户，或者该用户无法访问个人资料屏幕。','Profile items could not be detected because users in this role are blocked from the admin area by the Block Dashboard Access option.'=>'无法检测到个人资料项目，因为此角色中的用户被“阻止仪表板访问”选项阻止了管理员区域。','If you like %s, please leave us a %s rating. Thank you!'=>'如果您喜欢 %s，请给我们留一个 %s 评分。谢谢！','About PublishPress Capabilities'=>'关于 PublishPress 能力','About'=>'关于','Capabilites Documentation'=>'能力文档','Documentation'=>'文档','Contact the PublishPress team'=>'联系 PublishPress 团队','Contact'=>'联系','Use the exact input types shown in discovery.'=>'使用发现中显示的确切输入类型。','List capabilities'=>'列出能力','List known role, post-type and taxonomy capabilities, optionally filtered by name.'=>'列出已知的角色、帖子类型和分类法能力，可按名称进行筛选。','Compare roles'=>'比较角色','Compare stored role grants and denials. Null means a capability is absent, false means explicitly denied.'=>'比较存储的角色授予和拒绝。空值表示缺少功能，false表示明确拒绝。','Create role'=>'创建角色','Create an empty role or copy capabilities from source_role. Does not overwrite an existing role. Use update-role-capabilities for grants. MCP refuses copying administrator-level capabilities.'=>'创建一个空角色或从source_role复制功能。不会覆盖现有角色。使用update-role-capabilities进行授予。MCP拒绝复制管理员级别的功能。','Rename role'=>'重命名角色','Change a role display name while retaining its slug, users, settings and capabilities.'=>'更改角色的显示名称，同时保留其slug、用户、设置和功能。','Delete role'=>'删除角色','Delete a custom editable role. Existing users with no remaining role move to the site default. System/default/own roles are protected.'=>'删除一个自定义可编辑角色。现有用户如果没有剩余角色，将转移到站点默认角色。系统/默认/自有角色受到保护。','Update role capabilities'=>'更新角色功能','Patch capabilities: grant=true, deny=false, remove=unset. Unmentioned capabilities remain unchanged. Use dry_run to inspect before/after without saving. Changes are validated before writes. MCP refuses new administrator-level grants, including in dry runs.'=>'补丁功能：grant=true，deny=false，remove=unset。未提及的功能保持不变。使用dry_run在不保存的情况下检查前后状态。更改在写入前经过验证。MCP拒绝新的管理员级别授予，包括在dry_run中。','Get role options'=>'获取角色选项','Read role editor preference, login/dashboard access and assignment disabling settings.'=>'读取角色编辑器偏好、登录/仪表板访问和分配禁用设置。','Update role options'=>'更新角色选项','Patch role options without changing capabilities. Administrator/default/own-role lockout protections apply.'=>'补丁角色选项而不更改功能。管理员/默认/自有角色锁定保护适用。','List features'=>'列出功能','Discover all Capabilities menus, enabled states, permission names and supported configuration fields.'=>'发现所有功能菜单、启用状态、权限名称和支持的配置字段。','Set feature enabled'=>'设置功能启用','Enable or disable a Capabilities dashboard feature on this site. Disabled features reject their configuration actions.'=>'在此站点上启用或禁用一个功能仪表板功能。禁用的功能拒绝其配置操作。','Get feature choices'=>'获取功能选择','Discover existing editor/admin elements, captured profile/frontend elements, menu snapshots with exact restriction_value identifiers, navigation items or admin style templates. Does not capture new browser UI.'=>'发现现有的编辑器/管理员元素、捕获的配置文件/前端元素、具有确切restriction_value标识符的菜单快照、导航项或管理员样式模板。不会捕获新的浏览器UI。','Get feature settings'=>'获取功能设置','Read a role\'s settings for an enabled feature. Editor restrictions are specific to post_type and editor. Navigation also supports ppc_guest and ppc_users.'=>'读取角色的设置以启用功能。编辑器限制特定于post_type和编辑器。导航还支持ppc_guest和ppc_users。','Update feature settings'=>'更新功能设置','Patch feature settings for one role. List fields replace their lists; unmentioned fields and other roles remain unchanged. dry_run validates and returns proposed values without saving. Discover fields with list-features. For admin-menus, first get-feature-choices and use discovery restriction_value identifiers. New unknown menu identifiers are rejected.'=>'为一个角色补丁功能设置。列表字段替换其列表；未提及的字段和其他角色保持不变。dry_run验证并返回拟议值而不保存。使用list-features发现字段。对于管理员菜单，首先获取功能选择并使用发现的restriction_value标识符。新的未知菜单标识符将被拒绝。','Bulk update feature settings'=>'批量更新功能设置','Apply the same feature settings to multiple roles, validating all targets before writing. dry_run returns proposed settings only.'=>'将相同的功能设置应用于多个角色，在写入之前验证所有目标。dry_run仅返回拟议设置。','Get plugin settings'=>'获取插件设置','Read Capabilities > Settings and the supported setting descriptions. Includes Roles > Multiples roles on Add New User and User Edit (Edit User), Editor Features > Show private post types, Capabilities visibility, User Testing, Admin Menus and Pro settings.'=>'读取功能 > 设置和支持的设置描述。包括角色 > 在添加新用户和用户编辑（编辑用户）上多个角色，编辑器功能 > 显示私有帖子类型，功能可见性，用户测试，管理员菜单和专业设置。','Update plugin settings'=>'更新插件设置','Enable, disable or update Capabilities > Settings options. Supports multiple roles on Add New User or User Edit (Edit User), Show private post types under Editor Features or Capabilities, User Testing and Admin Menus settings. Read get-plugin-settings to identify the exact field. Change only the requested field. This saves individual settings, unlike set-feature-enabled which toggles whole screens.'=>'启用、禁用或更新功能 > 设置选项。在添加新用户或用户编辑（编辑用户）上支持多个角色，在编辑器功能或功能下显示私有帖子类型，用户测试和管理员菜单设置。读取获取插件设置以识别确切字段。仅更改请求的字段。这会保存单个设置，与set-feature-enabled不同，后者切换整个屏幕。','List backups'=>'列出备份','List saved manual, initial and automatic Capabilities role backups. Returns identifiers for restore-backup.'=>'列出保存的手动、初始和自动功能角色备份。返回用于restore-backup的标识符。','Create backup'=>'创建备份','Save the current roles and plugin feature settings using the existing manual backup format. Replaces the last manual backup.'=>'使用现有的手动备份格式保存当前角色和插件功能设置。替换最后一个手动备份。','Restore backup'=>'恢复备份','Restore a listed backup. Manual backups include feature settings; initial/automatic backups restore roles. Use dry_run before applying.'=>'恢复列出的备份。手动备份包括功能设置；初始/自动备份恢复角色。在应用之前使用dry_run。','Export configuration'=>'导出配置','Export plugin-owned configuration in the same allowlisted format used by the Backup screen. Returns available_sections for selective export and optionally filters user_roles by role slug. Contains permission configuration, not password secrets.'=>'以与备份屏幕使用的相同允许格式导出插件拥有的配置。返回available_sections以进行选择性导出，并可选择按角色slug过滤user_roles。包含权限配置，而不包含密码秘密。','Import configuration'=>'导入配置','Validate and import a configuration export using the existing backup validators. Reject unsupported entries before writing; dry_run validates without saving. MCP rejects new administrator-level grants.'=>'使用现有的备份验证程序验证和导入配置导出。在写入之前拒绝不支持的条目；dry_run在不保存的情况下进行验证。MCP拒绝新的管理员级别授予。','Save interface element'=>'保存界面元素','Create or update a profile selector or frontend selector/CSS/body-class element. Does not enable it for a role; use update-feature-settings afterwards.'=>'创建或更新一个配置文件选择器或前端选择器/CSS/body-class 元素。此操作并不为角色启用它；请在之后使用 update-feature-settings。','Delete interface element'=>'删除界面元素','Delete a profile/frontend element and remove its saved restriction references.'=>'删除一个配置文件/前端元素并移除其保存的限制引用。','Update admin menu presentation'=>'更新管理菜单展示','Rename menus for a role, set global menu/submenu ordering, update menu UI settings, or reset custom presentation. This does not change capabilities.'=>'为角色重命名菜单，设置全局菜单/子菜单排序，更新菜单 UI 设置，或重置自定义展示。这不会更改能力。','Save admin style'=>'保存管理样式','Create/update a named custom admin color style using existing sanitizers and CSS generation. Free supports one custom style; Pro supports multiple.'=>'使用现有的清理器和 CSS 生成创建/更新一个命名的自定义管理颜色样式。免费版支持一个自定义样式；专业版支持多个。','Delete admin style'=>'删除管理样式','Delete a custom admin style and its generated CSS. Roles using it return to the default color scheme.'=>'删除一个自定义管理样式及其生成的 CSS。使用该样式的角色将返回默认颜色方案。','List application password scopes'=>'列出应用密码范围','List manageable application password names and denied capabilities. Returns no plaintext passwords or hashes. Requires the application-password capabilities feature to be enabled.'=>'列出可管理的应用密码名称和被拒绝的能力。不会返回明文密码或哈希值。需要启用应用密码能力特性。','Update application password scope'=>'更新应用密码范围','Replace the denied capability list for one application password. Restrictions only reduce its user\'s capabilities; they do not grant privileges.'=>'替换一个应用密码的被拒绝能力列表。限制仅减少其用户的能力；它们不会授予特权。','Update user roles'=>'更新用户角色','Replace an existing site user\'s assigned roles using the profile form rules. Requires multiple-role editing to be enabled, preserves forum roles, and supports dry_run. Newly assigned administrator-level roles are refused by MCP.'=>'使用配置文件表单规则替换现有站点用户的分配角色。需要启用多角色编辑，保留论坛角色，并支持 dry_run。新分配的管理员级别角色被 MCP 拒绝。','Get user capabilities'=>'获取用户能力','Inspect a site member\'s roles and effective capability values, as on the User Capabilities screen. No identity switching or user changes.'=>'检查站点成员的角色和有效能力值，如同在用户能力屏幕上。没有身份切换或用户更改。','Check user capability'=>'检查用户能力','Test a user\'s effective permission, optionally for an object ID. Applies WordPress permission filters without impersonating that user or changing the MCP session.'=>'测试用户的有效权限，可选地针对一个对象 ID。应用 WordPress 权限过滤器，无需冒充该用户或更改 MCP 会话。','Choose an editable role for profile capture.'=>'选择一个可编辑角色以进行配置文件捕获。','A post type or taxonomy does not exist.'=>'一个 post type 或 taxonomy 不存在。','Post not found.'=>'未找到帖子。','A frontend element does not exist.'=>'一个前端元素不存在。','Invalid menu slug.'=>'无效的菜单 slug。','Custom menu not found.'=>'未找到自定义菜单。','Title, capability and submenu parent are required.'=>'标题、能力和子菜单父项是必需的。','Unsupported menu URL.'=>'不支持的菜单 URL。','Prepare profile capture'=>'准备配置文件捕获','Enable/disable the existing five-minute profile capture window and return the admin page to visit. Actual DOM capture runs in the browser with its own authenticated session.'=>'启用/禁用现有的五分钟配置文件捕获窗口，并返回管理页面以进行访问。实际的 DOM 捕获在浏览器中运行，拥有自己的身份验证会话。','Update admin feature UI settings'=>'更新管理功能 UI 设置','Set the Admin Features hide-submenu preference. This is a global presentation preference, not a role access rule.'=>'设置管理功能隐藏子菜单的偏好。这是一个全局展示偏好，而不是角色访问规则。','Get type capability settings'=>'获取类型能力设置','Read type-specific post/taxonomy capability mappings and discover registered types.'=>'读取特定类型的帖子/taxonomy 能力映射并发现注册的类型。','Update type capability settings'=>'更新类型能力设置','Patch type-specific capabilities and detailed taxonomy mapping. Detailed taxonomies also enable type-specific capabilities. Takes effect on the next request.'=>'修补特定类型的能力和详细的 taxonomy 映射。详细的 taxonomy 也启用特定类型的能力。将在下一个请求中生效。','Set role level'=>'设置角色级别','Set a legacy WordPress role level from 0 to 10. Administrator stays at level 10. dry_run previews capability changes.'=>'设置一个遗留 WordPress 角色级别，从 0 到 10。管理员保持在 10 级。dry_run 预览能力更改。','Reset roles'=>'重置角色','Role reset requires the native Backup screen. MCP refuses recovery hooks that could introduce administrator-level grants.'=>'角色重置需要本机备份屏幕。MCP 拒绝可能引入管理员级别权限的恢复钩子。','Test user access'=>'测试用户访问','Test an eligible user’s permission through the User Testing access rules without switching cookies or the MCP identity.'=>'通过用户测试访问规则测试合格用户的权限，无需切换 Cookie 或 MCP 身份。','Sync role network'=>'同步角色网络','Queue the existing role/capability and option synchronization across network sites. Requires a main-site network administrator. MCP refuses synchronization of roles with administrator-level capabilities.'=>'在网络站点之间排队现有角色/能力和选项同步。需要主站点网络管理员。MCP 拒绝同步具有管理员级别能力的角色。','Get post frontend elements'=>'获取帖子前端元素','Read a post’s frontend element overrides (Pro), respecting edit_post permission.'=>'读取帖子的前端元素覆盖（Pro），尊重 edit_post 权限。','Set post frontend elements'=>'设置帖子前端元素','Replace a post’s enabled frontend element overrides (Pro). Empty list clears them.'=>'替换帖子的启用前端元素覆盖（Pro）。空列表将清除它们。','Manage custom admin menu'=>'管理自定义管理员菜单','Create/update/delete a custom admin menu or separator (Pro). Menu data contains no executable callbacks. Refreshes menu snapshots.'=>'创建/更新/删除自定义管理员菜单或分隔符（Pro）。菜单数据不包含可执行回调。刷新菜单快照。','Choose section identifiers returned by export discovery.'=>'选择导出发现返回的部分标识符。','Role selection requires the user_roles export section.'=>'角色选择需要 user_roles 导出部分。','An export role does not exist.'=>'导出角色不存在。','Choose a backup returned by list-backups.'=>'选择 list-backups 返回的备份。','Configuration contains an unsupported setting.'=>'配置包含不支持的设置。','Invalid role definitions.'=>'无效的角色定义。','The administrator role must retain access to WordPress and Capabilities.'=>'管理员角色必须保留对 WordPress 和能力的访问。','Imported roles must include the default role.'=>'导入的角色必须包括默认角色。','Invalid configuration value.'=>'无效的配置值。','No configuration was supplied.'=>'未提供任何配置。','Actions provided by PublishPress plugins.'=>'由 PublishPress 插件提供的操作。','A label and selector or URL are required.'=>'需要标签和选择器或 URL。','Custom rule not found.'=>'未找到自定义规则。','List custom rules'=>'列出自定义规则','List Pro custom editor selectors, hidden admin elements or blocked URLs, including the exact restriction values used by feature settings.'=>'列出 Pro 自定义编辑器选择器、隐藏的管理员元素或被阻止的 URL，包括功能设置中使用的确切限制值。','Save custom rule'=>'保存自定义规则','Create/update a Pro custom editor selector, admin CSS hiding rule or blocked-URL rule. Save its restriction_value in the role feature settings to enable it.'=>'创建/更新 Pro 自定义编辑器选择器、管理员 CSS 隐藏规则或被阻止的 URL 规则。将其 restriction_value 保存在角色功能设置中以启用它。','Delete custom rule'=>'删除自定义规则','Delete a Pro custom restriction rule and its role restriction references.'=>'删除 Pro 自定义限制规则及其角色限制引用。','Unknown feature.'=>'未知功能。','This post type is not available in Editor Features.'=>'此帖子类型在编辑器功能中不可用。','Role not found.'=>'未找到角色。','The role is not editable.'=>'该角色不可编辑。','A profile element in the order does not exist.'=>'订单中的配置文件元素不存在。','Redirects must be valid URLs on this site.'=>'重定向必须是此站点上的有效 URL。','Network synchronization requires the main-site network administrator.'=>'网络同步需要主站点网络管理员。','This feature cannot be toggled.'=>'此功能无法切换。','Admin Toolbar'=>'管理员工具栏','Header and Footer'=>'页眉和页脚','Dashboard widgets'=>'仪表板小部件','Choose an existing role to discover Profile Features.'=>'选择现有角色以发现配置文件功能。','Use restriction_value from the selected editor layout. Custom selectors and metaboxes require Pro and previously saved or captured data.'=>'使用所选编辑器布局中的限制值。自定义选择器和元框需要专业版以及先前保存或捕获的数据。','Use restriction_value for toolbar, header/footer and dashboard items. Visit the WordPress dashboard as an authorized administrator to refresh captured widgets and toolbar nodes.'=>'使用工具栏、页眉/页脚和仪表板项的限制值。作为授权管理员访问WordPress仪表板以刷新捕获的小部件和工具栏节点。','Profile choices belong to the selected role. If empty or incomplete, use prepare-profile-capture for that role and complete capture in the browser. Use each element restriction_value when saving disabled items.'=>'个人资料选择属于所选角色。如果为空或不完整，请使用prepare-profile-capture为该角色完成浏览器中的捕获。保存禁用项时使用每个元素的限制值。','These are saved frontend selectors, styles and body-class elements with their page and post-type scopes. Use restriction_value to select them. Use save-interface-element to create a missing element. Reading choices does not install demo elements.'=>'这些是保存的前端选择器、样式和主体类元素及其页面和帖子类型范围。使用限制值选择它们。使用save-interface-element创建缺失的元素。读取选择不会安装演示元素。','Notice types and toolbar access are configured with the fields below. Read actual per-role settings with get-feature-settings.'=>'通知类型和工具栏访问通过以下字段配置。使用get-feature-settings读取每个角色的实际设置。','Read actual per-role redirect targets with get-feature-settings. Use WordPress content lookup to resolve a destination rather than guessing a post ID.'=>'使用get-feature-settings读取每个角色的实际重定向目标。使用WordPress内容查找解析目标，而不是猜测帖子ID。','These are existing navigation menus and their items. Use their actual menu-item IDs when saving restrictions.'=>'这些是现有的导航菜单及其项目。保存限制时使用它们的实际菜单项ID。','These are available templates, saved custom styles and color schemes. Read actual per-role style settings with get-feature-settings.'=>'这些是可用的模板、保存的自定义样式和配色方案。使用get-feature-settings读取每个角色的实际样式设置。','Use the menu discovery restriction values and refresh instructions.'=>'使用菜单发现限制值和刷新说明。','Editor Features > Show private post types. Display non-public post types in Editor Features. This does not change the Capabilities screen visibility setting.'=>'编辑器功能 > 显示私有帖子类型。在编辑器功能中显示非公开的帖子类型。这不会更改能力屏幕的可见性设置。','Capabilities > Show private taxonomies. Include non-public taxonomies when editing role capabilities.'=>'能力 > 显示私有分类法。在编辑角色能力时包含非公开的分类法。','Capabilities > Show private post types. Include non-public post types when editing role capabilities, not the Editor Features setting.'=>'能力 > 显示私有帖子类型。在编辑角色能力时包含非公开的帖子类型，而不是编辑器功能设置。','Capabilities > Application password capabilities. Enable per-application-password capability restrictions.'=>'能力 > 应用密码能力。启用每个应用密码的能力限制。','Roles > Multiples roles on "Add New User" screen. Allow assigning multiple roles when creating a new user. This is separate from editing existing users.'=>'角色 > 在“添加新用户”屏幕上多个角色。允许在创建新用户时分配多个角色。这与编辑现有用户是分开的。','Roles > Multiples roles on "User Edit" screen. Enable multiple-role editing for existing users on Edit User. This is separate from Add New User.'=>'角色 > 在“用户编辑”屏幕上多个角色。启用对现有用户的多角色编辑。这与添加新用户是分开的。','Editor Features > Classic Editor tab. Show controls for Classic Editor restrictions.'=>'编辑器功能 > 经典编辑器选项卡。显示经典编辑器限制的控件。','User Testing > Admin Bar. Add the user-testing link to the admin toolbar.'=>'用户测试 > 管理员工具栏。在管理员工具栏中添加用户测试链接。','User Testing > Admin Bar search. Allow searching for a user to test from the toolbar.'=>'用户测试 > 管理员工具栏搜索。允许从工具栏搜索要测试的用户。','User Testing > Front End footer notice. Show a return link while testing a user.'=>'用户测试 > 前端页脚通知。在测试用户时显示返回链接。','Admin Menus > Treatment of multiple roles. True selects most restrictive, false selects most permissive.'=>'管理员菜单 > 多个角色的处理。true选择最严格，false选择最宽松。','Profile Features > Automatic redirection. Control automatic redirection during profile feature capture.'=>'个人资料功能 > 自动重定向。在个人资料功能捕获期间控制自动重定向。','Redirects > Return to the same page. Track the last visited page for applicable login redirects.'=>'重定向 > 返回同一页面。跟踪适用的登录重定向的最后访问页面。','User Testing > Exclude role from User Testing. List role slugs whose users cannot be tested.'=>'用户测试 > 从用户测试中排除角色。列出无法测试其用户的角色标识符。','Pro > Display PublishPress branding. Show or hide plugin branding.'=>'专业版 > 显示PublishPress品牌。显示或隐藏插件品牌。','Pro > Custom status control. Enable supported custom status capability handling when the status integration is available.'=>'专业版 > 自定义状态控制。当状态集成可用时，启用支持的自定义状态能力处理。','Pro > Custom status post permissions. Enable post-specific status capabilities. Requires custom status control.'=>'专业版 > 自定义状态帖子权限。启用特定于帖子的状态能力。需要自定义状态控制。','Pro > Privacy statuses. Enable privacy status integration when its dependencies are available.'=>'专业版 > 隐私状态。当其依赖项可用时，启用隐私状态集成。','Pro > Custom privacy editing capabilities. Use the available privacy integration editing rules.'=>'专业版 > 自定义隐私编辑能力。使用可用的隐私集成编辑规则。','Use the exact setting types shown in discovery. Lists must contain values of the declared type.'=>'使用发现中显示的确切设置类型。列表必须包含声明类型的值。','An excluded role does not exist.'=>'排除的角色不存在。','MCP tools cannot grant administrator-level access. Use the WordPress admin screens for this change.'=>'MCP工具无法授予管理员级别的访问权限。请使用WordPress管理员屏幕进行此更改。','Use the element identifier returned by discovery.'=>'使用发现返回的元素标识符。','An element label is required.'=>'需要元素标签。','A selector is required.'=>'需要选择器。','A selector, stylesheet, or body class is required.'=>'需要选择器、样式表或主体类。','Specify page types or post types.'=>'指定页面类型或帖子类型。','A post type does not exist.'=>'帖子类型不存在。','Element not found.'=>'未找到元素。','The menu action is missing required fields.'=>'菜单操作缺少必需字段。','Unsupported menu action.'=>'不支持的菜单操作。','You cannot manage this application password.'=>'您无法管理此应用程序密码。','A capability is not recognized.'=>'未识别的能力。','Use restriction_value exactly as returned. If discovery is empty or a menu is missing, open the Admin Menus page as an authorized administrator, then request choices again. Do not invent identifiers or infer which menus a role can access from this snapshot.'=>'请准确使用 restriction_value 的返回值。如果发现为空或菜单缺失，请以授权管理员身份打开管理菜单页面，然后再次请求选项。请勿凭空发明标识符或推断角色可以访问的菜单。','A new menu restriction was not found in discovery. Request get-feature-choices for admin-menus and use its restriction_value. If missing, open the Admin Menus page and try again.'=>'在发现中未找到新的菜单限制。请求 get-feature-choices 以获取 admin-menus，并使用其 restriction_value。如果缺失，请打开管理菜单页面并重试。','The Pro settings integration is not available.'=>'Pro 设置集成不可用。','Custom status settings are unavailable or controlled by the active status integration.'=>'自定义状态设置不可用或受活动状态集成控制。','Enable supported custom status control before status-specific editing capabilities.'=>'在状态特定编辑功能之前，请启用支持的自定义状态控制。','Privacy settings require the active Permissions Pro status integration.'=>'隐私设置需要活动的 Permissions Pro 状态集成。','A requested privacy setting is locked by site configuration.'=>'请求的隐私设置被站点配置锁定。','Use an unused role slug, 2–40 lowercase letters, numbers or underscores, starting with a letter.'=>'使用未使用的角色标识符，由 2-40 个小写字母、数字或下划线组成，并以字母开头。','A capability already uses this name.'=>'某个能力已经使用了这个名称。','The source role is not editable.'=>'源角色是不可编辑的。','A role name is required.'=>'需要角色名称。','The role could not be created.'=>'角色无法创建。','You cannot change that capability.'=>'您无法更改该能力。','Administrators must retain read, manage_options and manage_capabilities.'=>'管理员必须保留读取、管理选项和管理能力。','The default role must retain read access.'=>'默认角色必须保留读取访问权限。','This role must retain read access to avoid dashboard lockout.'=>'此角色必须保留读取访问权限以避免仪表板锁定。','System, default and uneditable roles cannot be deleted.'=>'系统、默认和不可编辑角色无法删除。','You cannot delete your own role.'=>'您无法删除自己的角色。','The role could not be deleted.'=>'角色无法删除。','PublishPress Permissions is not active.'=>'PublishPress Permissions 未激活。','Only the main-site network administrator can configure new-site roles.'=>'只有主站点网络管理员可以配置新站点角色。','Classic Editor is not installed.'=>'Classic Editor 未安装。','WooCommerce is not active.'=>'WooCommerce 未激活。','You cannot lock out administrators or your own role.'=>'您无法锁定管理员或您自己的角色。','The default role cannot be disabled.'=>'默认角色无法禁用。','This role level cannot be changed.'=>'此角色级别无法更改。','List roles'=>'列出角色','List the current site’s registered role slugs and names. Does not change roles or return users.'=>'列出当前站点注册的角色标识符和名称。不会更改角色或返回用户。','Get role capabilities'=>'获取角色能力','Read a registered role’s stored capability grants and denials. These are role settings, not an individual user’s effective permissions.'=>'读取注册角色的存储能力授予和拒绝。这些是角色设置，而不是单个用户的有效权限。','User not found on this site.'=>'在此站点上未找到用户。','Enable multiple-role editing in the plugin settings first.'=>'请先在插件设置中启用多角色编辑。','Products'=>'产品','Orders'=>'订单','Subscriptions'=>'订阅','Upsell Paths'=>'追加销售路径','Permissions & Access'=>'权限与访问','Administer advanced content permissions and visibility rules.'=>'管理高级内容权限和可见性规则。','Manage plugin permission settings.'=>'管理插件权限设置。','Bypass content restrictions for editorial workflows.'=>'绕过内容限制以进行编辑工作流程。','Set custom post statuses for content items.'=>'为内容项设置自定义帖子状态。','Force Quick Edit access when restrictions would otherwise block it.'=>'当限制会阻止访问时强制快速编辑访问。','Roles & Groups'=>'角色与组','Assign or change role assignments for users.'=>'为用户分配或更改角色。','Create new permission groups.'=>'创建新的权限组。','Edit existing permission groups.'=>'编辑现有的权限组。','Delete permission groups.'=>'删除权限组。','Add or remove members from permission groups.'=>'添加或移除权限组的成员。','Create network-wide permission groups in multisite.'=>'在多站点中创建网络范围的权限组。','Manage members of network-wide permission groups.'=>'管理网络范围权限组的成员。','Exception Management'=>'例外管理','Set per-item association exceptions.'=>'设置每项关联的例外。','Set per-item edit exceptions.'=>'设置每项编辑的例外。','Set per-item read exceptions.'=>'设置每项读取的例外。','Set per-item revision exceptions.'=>'设置每项修订的例外。','Set taxonomy term assignment exceptions.'=>'设置分类法术语分配的例外。','Set taxonomy term association exceptions.'=>'设置分类法术语关联的例外。','Set taxonomy term management exceptions.'=>'设置分类法术语管理的例外。','Content Associations'=>'内容关联','Associate users or groups with any page.'=>'将用户或组与任何页面关联。','Define and apply custom post statuses.'=>'定义并应用自定义帖子状态。','Define custom privacy policies for content.'=>'为内容定义自定义隐私政策。','Moderate any item regardless of authorship.'=>'无论作者身份如何，审核任何项目。','Media & Misc'=>'媒体与杂项','Edit attachments uploaded by the current user.'=>'编辑当前用户上传的附件。','List unattached files uploaded by other users.'=>'列出其他用户上传的未附加文件。','List all media library files.'=>'列出所有媒体库文件。','Exempt user from edit-circle restrictions.'=>'免除用户的编辑圈限制。','Exempt user from read-circle restrictions.'=>'免除用户的读取圈限制。','see %1$sRole Usage%2$s: "Pattern Roles"'=>'查看 %1$s角色使用情况%2$s: "模式角色"','activate %1$sAdvanced settings%2$s, see Role Usage'=>'激活 %1$s高级设置%2$s，查看角色使用情况','"Posts" capabilities selected here also define type-specific role assignment for Permission Groups%s.'=>'"帖子" 在这里选择的能力还定义了权限组%s的类型特定角色分配。','"Posts" capabilities selected here also define type-specific role assignment for Permit Groups%s.'=>'"帖子" 在这里选择的能力还定义了许可组%s的类型特定角色分配。','Capabilities for custom statuses can be manually added here. (See %sPermissions > Post Statuses%s for applicable names). %sSupplemental status-specific roles%s are usually more convenient, though.'=>'自定义状态的能力可以在此手动添加。（请参见 %s权限 > 帖子状态%s 获取适用名称）。%s补充状态特定角色%s 通常更方便。','Capabilities for custom statuses can be manually added here. Or activate the PP Custom Post Statuses extension to assign status-specific supplemental roles.'=>'自定义状态的能力可以在此手动添加。或者激活 PP 自定义帖子状态扩展以分配状态特定的补充角色。','Capabilities for custom statuses can be manually added to a role here (see Conditions > Status > Capability Mapping for applicable names). However, it is usually more convenient to use Permit Groups to assign a supplemental status-specific role.'=>'自定义状态的能力可以在此手动添加到角色中（请参见条件 > 状态 > 能力映射以获取适用名称）。然而，使用许可组分配补充状态特定角色通常更方便。','Unique Post Type Capabilities'=>'独特的帖子类型能力','Allow post type permissions to be controlled separately from other areas of WordPress. %1$sFind out more.%2$s'=>'允许帖子类型权限与 WordPress 的其他区域单独控制。%1$s了解更多信息.%2$s','Use the "Create" capability for selected post types'=>'使用 "创建" 功能来为所选的帖子类型','This will cause a new capability to be required for creating posts, and enable a checkbox column here for role assignments. Normally, post creation is controlled by the "Edit" capability.'=>'这将要求创建帖子需要新的功能，并在这里启用一个复选框列以进行角色分配。通常，帖子创建由 "编辑" 功能控制。','Update'=>'更新','Unique Taxonomy Capabilities'=>'独特的分类法功能','Allow taxonomy permissions to be controlled separately from other areas of WordPress.'=>'允许单独控制分类法权限，不与 WordPress 的其他区域相关联。','Detailed Taxonomy Capabilities'=>'详细的分类法功能','Allow "Edit", "Delete" and "Assign" capabilities separately from the "Manage" capability.'=>'允许单独的 "编辑"、"删除" 和 "分配" 功能与 "管理" 功能分开。','Login Redirect'=>'登录重定向','Logout Redirect'=>'注销重定向','Registration Redirect'=>'注册重定向','First Login Redirect'=>'首次登录重定向','Enter the URL users in this role should be redirected to after login.'=>'输入该角色的用户登录后应重定向到的 URL。','Enter the URL users in this role should be redirected to after logout.'=>'输入该角色的用户注销后应重定向到的 URL。','Enter the URL users in this role should be redirected to after registration.'=>'输入该角色的用户注册后应重定向到的 URL。','Enter the URL users in this role should be redirected to after their first login.'=>'输入该角色的用户首次登录后应重定向到的 URL。','%s Redirects'=>'%s 重定向','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','Redirect users to the URL they were viewing before login.'=>'将用户重定向到他们登录前查看的 URL。','Redirect users to a specified URL.'=>'将用户重定向到指定的 URL。','Enter the relative path only without domain for login redirect.'=>'仅输入相对路径，不带域名用于登录重定向。','You must enter the Login Redirect URL.'=>'您必须输入登录重定向 URL。','Enter the relative path only without domain for logout redirect.'=>'仅输入相对路径，不带域名用于注销重定向。','Redirect Features allows you to redirect users in a role after Registration, Login or Logout.'=>'重定向功能允许您在注册、登录或注销后重定向角色中的用户。','How to use Redirect Features'=>'如何使用重定向功能','You do not have sufficient permissions to perform this action.'=>'您没有足够的权限来执行此操作。','Your link has expired, refresh the page and try again.'=>'您的链接已过期，请刷新页面并重试。','Please try again.'=>'请再试一次。','Missing parameters, refresh the page and try again.'=>'缺少参数，请刷新页面并重试。','Invalid role name entry: %s'=>'无效的角色名称输入：%s','The role "%s" already exists. Please choose a different name.'=>'角色 "%s" 已经存在。请选择一个不同的名称。','Something went wrong, the system wasn\'t able to create the role, refresh the page and try again.'=>'出现了问题，系统无法创建角色，请刷新页面并重试。','The new role %s was created successfully.'=>'新角色 %s 创建成功。','The default role cannot be disabled. Change the default role in WordPress settings first.'=>'默认角色无法禁用。请首先在 WordPress 设置中更改默认角色。','%s role updated successfully.'=>'%s 角色更新成功。','Cannot delete default role. You <a href="%s">have to change it first</a>.'=>'无法删除默认角色。您 <a href="%s">必须先更改它</a>。','Deleting a system role is not allowed.'=>'不允许删除系统角色。','%1$d users moved to default role %2$s.'=>'%1$d 用户已移至默认角色 %2$s。','The role %1$s was successfully deleted. %2$s'=>'角色 %1$s 已成功删除。 %2$s','The selected %1$s roles were successfully deleted. %2$s'=>'所选的 %1$s 角色已成功删除。 %2$s','The role %1$s was successfully hidden.'=>'角色 %1$s 已成功隐藏。','The role %1$s was successfully unhidden.'=>'角色 %1$s 已成功取消隐藏。','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Disable / Delete'=>'禁用 / 删除','Gutenberg editor'=>'古腾堡编辑器','Classic editor'=>'经典编辑器','Role Slug'=>'角色别名','The "slug" is the URL-friendly version of the role. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers and underscores.'=>'“别名”是角色的 URL 友好版本。它通常全部小写，仅包含字母、数字和下划线。','Block Login'=>'阻止登录','Block users in this role from logging into the site.'=>'阻止此角色的用户登录到网站。','Block Dashboard Access'=>'阻止仪表板访问','Block users in this role from accessing admin area.'=>'阻止此角色的用户访问管理区域。','Role Level'=>'角色级别','Each user role has a level from 0 to 10. The Subscriber role defaults to the lowest level (0). The Administrator role defaults to level 10.'=>'每个用户角色的级别从 0 到 10。订阅者角色默认为最低级别（0）。管理员角色默认为级别 10。','Disable Role'=>'禁用角色','Disable "%s" role for new user assignments. Existing users will keep this role and its capabilities.'=>'禁用“%s”角色的新用户分配。现有用户将保留此角色及其权限。','Deleting this role will completely remove it from database and is irrecoverable.'=>'删除此角色将完全从数据库中移除，无法恢复。','Disable Code Editor'=>'禁用代码编辑器','Disable the "Code editor" option for the Gutenberg block editor.'=>'禁用古腾堡块编辑器的“代码编辑器”选项。','Control Allowed Editors'=>'控制允许的编辑器','Select the allowed editor options for users in this role.'=>'为此角色的用户选择允许的编辑器选项。','Disable WooCommerce admin restrictions'=>'禁用 WooCommerce 管理限制','By default, WooCommerce prevents most users from accessing the WordPress admin area. When enabled, this setting will remove those restrictions for this role. %1s Click here for more details. %2s'=>'默认情况下，WooCommerce 阻止大多数用户访问 WordPress 管理区域。当启用时，此设置将删除此角色的这些限制。%1s 点击此处了解更多详细信息。%2s','Slug already exists'=>'别名已存在','Select allowed editor'=>'选择允许的编辑器','You must select at least one editor for the role when managing allowed editor.'=>'在管理允许的编辑器时，您必须为该角色选择至少一个编辑器。','Select %s'=>'选择 %s','Read more on Role Level.'=>'阅读更多关于角色级别的信息。','Are you sure you want to delete this role?'=>'您确定要删除此角色吗？','%s role copied. Please click the "Create Role" button to create this new role.'=>'%s 角色已复制。请点击“创建角色”按钮以创建此新角色。','Edit Role: %s'=>'编辑角色：%s','Copy Role'=>'复制角色','Create New Role'=>'创建新角色','These can be edited on the %1s Capabilities screen %2s'=>'这些可以在 %1s 权限屏幕 %2s 上进行编辑','Load More'=>'加载更多','Load Less'=>'加载较少','All %s'=>'所有 %s','Mine %s'=>'我的 %s','Has Users %s'=>'有用户 %s','No Users %s'=>'没有用户 %s','Disabled %s'=>'已禁用 %s','Editable %s'=>'可编辑 %s','Uneditable %s'=>'不可编辑 %s','System %s'=>'系统 %s','Copy'=>'复制','(non-editable role)'=>'(不可编辑角色)','Unhide'=>'显示','Select role %s'=>'选择角色 %s','Your Role'=>'您的角色','Disabled'=>'已禁用','WordPress Core'=>'WordPress Core','Search Roles'=>'搜索角色','Admin Menus: treatment of multiple roles'=>'管理员菜单：多个角色的处理','Most permissive: Any non-restricted user role allows access'=>'最宽松：任何非限制用户角色允许访问','Most restrictive: Any restricted user role prevents access'=>'最严格：任何限制用户角色禁止访问','This controls whether the most permissive or restrictive permissions are applied if a user has multiple roles.'=>'这控制如果用户有多个角色时应用最宽松或最严格的权限。','Multiples roles on "Add New User" screen'=>'在“添加新用户”屏幕上的多个角色','This allows you to assign a new user to multiples roles.'=>'这允许您将新用户分配给多个角色。','Multiples roles on "User Edit" screen'=>'在“用户编辑”屏幕上的多个角色','This allows you to assign an existing user to multiple roles.'=>'这允许您将现有用户分配给多个角色。','Set login redirect cookie'=>'设置登录重定向Cookie','Use cookie to determine pages users were viewing before login. This is useful when login redirect is not working correctly due to wp_get_referer() limitation.'=>'使用Cookie确定用户在登录前查看的页面。这在由于wp_get_referer()限制而导致登录重定向不正常工作时很有用。','Show private post types'=>'显示私有文章类型','This will show all post types on the "Capabilities" screen, even ones normally hidden in the WordPress admin area.'=>'这将在“能力”屏幕上显示所有文章类型，即使是通常在WordPress管理区域隐藏的类型。','Show private taxonomies'=>'显示私有分类法','This will show all taxonomies on the "Capabilities" screen, even ones normally hidden in the WordPress admin area.'=>'这将在“能力”屏幕上显示所有分类法，即使是通常在WordPress管理区域隐藏的分类法。','Application password capabilities'=>'应用密码能力','Allow the Capabilities screen to deny selected capabilities for individual WordPress application passwords.'=>'允许能力屏幕拒绝单个WordPress应用密码的选定能力。','Show all post types on the "Editor Features" screen, even ones normally hidden in the WordPress admin area.'=>'在“编辑器功能”屏幕上显示所有文章类型，即使是通常在WordPress管理区域隐藏的类型。','Enable Classic Editor tab'=>'启用经典编辑器标签','Always show the Classic Editor tab in "Editor Features" screen.'=>'在“编辑器功能”屏幕中始终显示经典编辑器标签。','Admin Bar modification'=>'管理员工具栏修改','When testing, display a caption and return link in the Admin Bar.'=>'测试时，在管理员工具栏中显示标题和返回链接。','Admin Bar search'=>'管理员工具栏搜索','Add option to search and user testing in the Admin Bar.'=>'在管理员工具栏中添加搜索和用户测试的选项。','Front End footer notice'=>'前端页脚通知','When testing, display a return link in the front end footer.'=>'测试时，在前端页脚中显示返回链接。','Exclude role from User Testing'=>'从用户测试中排除角色','Select roles...'=>'选择角色...','Exclude users in selected roles from User Testing.'=>'从用户测试中排除选定角色中的用户。','Automatically refresh profile elements'=>'自动刷新配置文件元素','Always try to automatically find profile elements. This may cause temporary issues when updating user roles that do not have access to the WordPress admin area.'=>'始终尝试自动查找配置文件元素。这可能会在更新没有访问WordPress管理区域的用户角色时导致临时问题。','Capabilities Settings'=>'能力设置','Search user'=>'搜索用户','Search user...'=>'搜索用户...','Search'=>'搜索','No results found.'=>'未找到结果。','Permission denied.'=>'权限被拒绝。','Test user'=>'测试用户','Test this user'=>'测试此用户','Testing: '=>'测试中: ','%1$sReturn to Administrator view%2$s'=>'%1$s返回管理员视图%2$s','Testing as user: %1$s. %2$sReturn to Administrator view%3$s'=>'作为用户测试: %1$s。 %2$s返回管理员视图%3$s','Back to Users'=>'返回用户','You are viewing the capabilities for this specific user.'=>'您正在查看该特定用户的能力。','Username'=>'用户名','Email'=>'电子邮件','Assigned Roles'=>'分配的角色','Network Access'=>'网络访问','Super Admin'=>'超级管理员','Granted Capabilities'=>'授予的能力','This user has no assigned roles.'=>'该用户没有分配的角色。','Granted Capabilities (%d)'=>'授予的能力 (%d)','These include known capabilities WordPress grants through Super Admin access, role assignments, and direct overrides.'=>'这些包括WordPress通过超级管理员访问、角色分配和直接覆盖授予的已知能力。','These are the capabilities assigned to this user in WordPress.'=>'这些是分配给该用户的WordPress能力。','This user has no granted capabilities.'=>'该用户没有授予的能力。','Search granted capabilities'=>'搜索授予的能力','Search granted capabilities...'=>'搜索授予的能力...','Type to filter this capability list.'=>'输入以过滤此能力列表。','No granted capabilities match your search.'=>'没有授予的能力与您的搜索匹配。','Denied Capabilities (%d)'=>'被拒绝的能力 (%d)','Direct User Overrides'=>'直接用户覆盖','These entries are stored directly on the user account instead of coming from a role.'=>'这些条目直接存储在用户帐户上，而不是来自角色。','These are permissions assigned to the user in the PublishPress Permissions plugin.'=>'这些是分配给用户的PublishPress Permissions插件中的权限。','Extra Roles (%d)'=>'额外角色 (%d)','This user has no direct extra roles.'=>'该用户没有直接的额外角色。','Specific Permissions (%d)'=>'特定权限 (%d)','This user has no direct specific permissions.'=>'该用户没有直接的特定权限。','Showing the first 50 of %d permissions. Use the Permissions editor to view the full list.'=>'显示%d个权限中的前50个。使用权限编辑器查看完整列表。','Inherited Group Permissions'=>'继承的组权限','Extra roles and specific permissions assigned to this user\'s active groups, including WordPress role groups. These assignments are managed on the group.'=>'分配给该用户的活跃组的额外角色和特定权限，包括WordPress角色组。 这些分配在组上进行管理。','This user has no group-assigned extra roles or specific permissions.'=>'该用户没有分配的额外角色或特定权限。','View Extra Roles'=>'查看额外角色','View Specific Permissions'=>'查看特定权限','You cannot change roles for this user.'=>'您无法更改该用户的角色。','Choose existing roles that you are allowed to assign.'=>'选择您被允许分配的现有角色。','A disabled role cannot be assigned.'=>'无法分配已禁用的角色。','You cannot remove your own roles through this action.'=>'您无法通过此操作删除自己的角色。']];